course: dictionary
lesson: 1046
title: Words that point to a place
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words tell you where something comes from. Bornean is one of them: it tells you that a thing is from, or belongs to, Borneo, a big tropical island in South-East Asia. «Bornean elephants are smaller than other Asian elephants, with bigger ears and long tails.» The sentence compares them with other Asian elephants, so Bornean must mean from Borneo.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. Ask: what does this word point to? Then swap your meaning into the sentence. «Elephants from Borneo are smaller than other Asian elephants» still makes sense, so you have the right meaning.
explain: Bornean can also be a noun. A Bornean is a person from Borneo, and more than one person is Borneans. Notice the capital B: words that name a place or its people start with a capital letter.
fact: Bornean means from or to do with Borneo.
fact: Borneo is the third-largest island in the world, in South-East Asia.
fact: Borneo is shared by Malaysia, Indonesia and Brunei.
fact: «Bornean» is an adjective in «Bornean elephants», and a noun in «a Bornean».
fact: Conservation lessons talk about protecting Bornean rainforests from logging and palm oil plantations.
exercise: «Bornean elephants are smaller than other Asian elephants.» What does Bornean mean here? | *Coming from Borneo | Coming from Japan | Very large
exercise: «Conservation lessons talk about protecting Bornean rainforests.» What are the Bornean rainforests? | Rainforests in Japan | Deserts on Borneo | Mountains in Scotland | *Rainforests on Borneo
exercise: Find the noun that means a person from Borneo. | Orangutan | Borneo's | *A Bornean | Elephant
test: Which of these is the third-largest island in the world? | Java | Sumatra | *Borneo | Ireland
test: Borneo is shared by Malaysia, Indonesia and Brunei. Which country is NOT on Borneo? | Indonesia | Malaysia | Brunei | *Japan
exam: Ella says Bornean means very big. What is the correct meaning? | Very old | Very big | A kind of rainforest animal | *From or to do with Borneo
